\newlabel{tab:bench}{{4}{18}{}{table.4}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Retrieval under the primary design. (a) Out-of-fold predicted versus measured Secchi depth. (b) Residuals by trophic zone; the retrieval overestimates in eutrophic Bah\'ia de Puno. (c) Benchmark against classical and linear baselines. (d) The unbounded classical implementation in log scale: one impossible prediction destroys the metric.}}{19}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:retr}{{5}{19}{}{figure.5}{}}
